the next couple of decades all of our
current most pressing problems,

00:03:49.663 --> 00:03:53.121
there will be new ones. But I think
we are going to get very safe,

00:03:53.454 --> 00:03:57.079
very inexpensive, carbon free
nuclear energy to work.

